---
title: "return_obligation - Share Obligation Object (Scallop Lend)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_version: check version == current_version
    q_check_version --> q_error_version: version mismatch
    q_error_version --> [*]: abort error
    q_check_version --> q_validate_hotpotato: version matches
    q_validate_hotpotato --> q_consume: validate ObligationHotPotato matches Obligation
    q_consume --> q_share: consume ObligationHotPotato (destroy)
    q_share --> [*]: share_object(Obligation)

    note right of q_validate_hotpotato
        INV-001: ObligationHotPotato must be consumed in same PTB as open_obligation
        INV-002: Obligation becomes shared object after return_obligation
        INV-003: HotPotato pattern enforces atomic creation-and-share
    end note
